# PRODIGY_DS_01 - Data Visualization

# Task Objective
To create a bar chart or histogram to visualize the distribution of a variable.

# Dataset
World Population Dataset

# Tools Used
- Python
- Pandas
- Matplotlib
- Seaborn

# What I Did
- Loaded and cleaned the dataset
- Selected population as a continuous variable
- Created histogram to show distribution
- Created bar chart for top 10 populated countries

# Key Insights
- Population distribution is highly skewed
- Most countries have low population
- Few countries contribute to very high population

